    (item "SDTS Issue #2: Rate limiter default mismatch (100 vs 10,000)")
    (item "SDTS Issue #3: Missing replay protection in Python")
    (item "SDTS Issue #1: AES-GCM wire format verification (false alarm, both compatible)")
